From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:57:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] KitKat UI P33: KitKat-style launcher icon for Stk (P33.3)

SIM Toolkit has no reference PNG in the set, so the drawer entry gets a synthesized KitKat-family tile: gray gradient, white SIM card with gold contacts - drawn by scripts/candyos-gen-icons.py.

Change-Id: Ia8aad082ad1db1d4f2ac003bcc93e94e9e533920
